umbrawg-tools (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BBRv3 and FEC for kernel and userspace interfaces.
  * Wire extension CAPS/ACK/FEC_SHARD, adaptive 2:1 FEC and BBR pacing.
  * Obfuscated ACK cadence, control-frame padding and FEC shard layout.
  * Fixes from the 2026-11-20 audit, including FEC profile validation.

